00:32:48.495 --> 00:32:50.304
So value this day!

00:32:50.304 --> 00:32:52.850
You want to make more money,
get serious about tomorrow.

00:32:52.850 --> 00:32:54.287
Value that day!

00:32:54.287 --> 00:32:56.550
Ask how you can add
more value into the day.

00:32:56.550 --> 00:32:58.193
Really work the day.

00:32:58.193 --> 00:33:01.158
And as you do that over
and over and over again,

00:33:01.158 --> 00:33:04.033
you ask how can I serve,
how can I contribute,

00:33:04.033 --> 00:33:05.550
how can I take it to the next level?

00:33:05.550 --> 00:33:08.260
You do that long enough, pffff!

00:33:08.260 --> 00:33:09.899
The breakthrough happens,
the magic happens,

00:33:09.899 --> 00:33:12.482
and money takes care of itself.

